Package: rsguide
Title: Diagnose Remote Sensing Data and Suggest Analyses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Henrique", "Paulo", , "mundo.virais@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Takes remote sensing data (rasters, vectors and tables with
    coordinates), automatically identifies the type of data, the bands,
    the likely sensor and the value scale, and suggests which analyses are
    possible. Each suggestion comes with a plain-language rationale,
    caveats and example code filled in with the user's own files and band
    names. Aimed at ecologists and newcomers to remote sensing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
